  Robbie Parker and the aftermath of the Sandy Hook shooting

  2/22/2025 | 25m 8s| (cc

  Steve Adubato welcomes Robbie Parker, Author of "A Father's Fight: Taking on
  Alex Jones and Reclaiming the Truth About

  Sandy Hook," for a powerful conversation about the impact of hate speech on
  Robbie and his family after the loss of their

  daughter, Emilie Parker, in the Sandy Hook Elementary School shooting.

  02/22/2025

  GENRE

  News And Public Affairs

